DepotDownloader
---------------
  Version:   3.4.0 (GitHub release DepotDownloader_3.4.0; official linux-x64 and linux-arm64 builds)
  License:   GNU General Public License v2.0 (GPL-2.0)
  Source:    https://github.com/SteamRE/DepotDownloader/tree/DepotDownloader_3.4.0
  Release:   https://github.com/SteamRE/DepotDownloader/releases/tag/DepotDownloader_3.4.0
  In image:  /opt/depotdownloader/DepotDownloader  the unmodified release binary
             /opt/depotdownloader/LICENSE          the GPL-2.0 text, as shipped in the release zip
             /opt/depotdownloader/RELEASE.txt      asset name, download URL and the sha256 verified at build

  DepotDownloader is used exactly as SteamRE released it. The Dockerfile downloads the zip for each
  architecture by pinned version and sha256 (ARG DD_VERSION, DD_SHA256_AMD64, DD_SHA256_ARM64),
  verifies it and unpacks it; it is not built from source, not modified and not vendored into this
  repository. The image runs it as a separate program: at build time to fetch the game files from
  Steam, and at run time for UPDATE_ON_START, AUTO_UPDATE_INTERVAL_MINUTES, MODS_WORKSHOP and
  MODS_COLLECTION, always with Steam's anonymous dedicated-server access. The GPL-2.0 applies to
  DepotDownloader itself; its corresponding source is the tagged tree linked above.

Necesse dedicated server
------------------------
  The game files under /app (Server.jar, lib/, locale/, the start scripts, and the Steamworks
  redistributables steamclient.so and libsteamwebrtc.so) are downloaded from Steam (app 1169370)
  with the anonymous dedicated-server subscription. They belong to their respective owners and
  are not covered by this repository's license; see /app/Licenses.txt inside the image.

